						<br>
					<<else>>
						<<link [[부끄럽다고 말한다 (진실)|Mansion Return Walk Undies Shy]]>><</link>>
						<br>
					<</if>>
				<<else>>
					"좀 재밌게 해볼까. 자랑도 좀 하고. 속옷만 남기고 벗어."
					<br><br>

					<<if ($worn.under_lower.name isnot "naked" and ($worn.under_upper.name isnot "naked" or $player.gender_appearance is "m"))>>
						<<if hasSexStat("exhibitionism", 3)>>
							<<link [[옷을 벗고 산책하러 나간다 (0:30)|Mansion Return Walk Undies Strip]]>><<set $phase to 1>><</link>><<exhibitionist3>>
							<br>
							<<link [[부끄럽다고 말한다 (거짓)|Mansion Return Walk Undies Strip Shy]]>><</link>>
							<br>
						<<else>>
							<<link [[부끄럽다고 말한다 (진실)|Mansion Return Walk Undies Strip Shy]]>><</link>>
							<br>
						<</if>>
					<<else>>
						<span class="lewd">옷을 벗으면 <<he>>【이가】 생각하는 것보다 훨씬 더 많이 노출하게 될 것이다.</span>
						<br><br>
						<<if hasSexStat("exhibitionism", 5)>>
							<<link [[옷을 벗고 산책하러 나간다 (0:30)|Mansion Return Walk Undies Strip]]>><<set $phase to 1>><</link>><<exhibitionist5>>
							<br>
