						<br>
					<<else>>
						<<link [[부끄럽다고 말한다 (진실)|Mansion Return Walk Naked Shy]]>><</link>>
						<br>
					<</if>>
				<<elseif $exposed gte 1>>
					"차림새는 완벽하군."
					<br><br>
					<span class="lewd"><<He>>【은는】 당신이 이러고 밖으로 나가길 원한다!</span>
					<br><br>
					<<if hasSexStat("exhibitionism", 3)>>
						<<link [[에이버리와 함께 산책한다 (0:30)|Mansion Return Walk Undies]]>><<set $phase to 1>><</link>><<exhibitionist3>>
						<br>
						<<link [[부끄럽다고 말한다 (거짓)|Mansion Return Walk Undies Shy]]>><</link>>
						<br>
					<<else>>
						<<link [[부끄럽다고 말한다 (진실)|Mansion Return Walk Undies Shy]]>><</link>>
						<br>
					<</if>>
				<<else>>
					<<link [[에이버리와 함께 산책한다 (0:30)|Mansion Return Walk]]>><</link>>
					<br>
				<</if>>
				<<link [[거절한다|Mansion Return Walk Refuse]]>><<npcincr Avery rage 1>><<npcincr Avery love -1>><</link>><<garage>><<llove>>
				<br>
				<<if $avery_mansion.jobs.includes("dungeon")>>
					<<link [["대신 지하 감옥으로 데려가 달라고 " + KR.getPronounKr("he", $NPCList[0].pronouns.he) + " 제안한다"|Mansion Dungeon Intro Ask]]>><<npcincr Avery dom 1>><</link>><<gdom>>
					<br>
				<</if>>
				<br>
			<</if>>
		<<elseif $rng is 4>>
			"뉴스에 꼭 봐야 할 게 있어," 에이버리가 말한다. "옆에 좀 있어 줘."
			<br><br>
			<<link [[에이버리와 함께 앉는다 (0:30)|Mansion Return Sit]]>><<pass 30>><<npcincr Avery love 1>><</link>><<glove>>
			<br>
			<<link [[핑계를 댄다|Mansion Return Sit Excuse]]>><<npcincr Avery rage 1>><<npcincr Avery love -1>><</link>><<garage>><<llove>>
			<br>
			<<if $avery_mansion.jobs.includes("dungeon")>>
				<<link [["대신 지하 감옥으로 데려가 달라고 " + KR.getPronounKr("he", $NPCList[0].pronouns.he) + " 제안한다"|Mansion Dungeon Intro Ask]]>><<npcincr Avery dom 1>><</link>><<gdom>>
				<br>
			<</if>>
		<<elseif $rng is 5>>
			"온수 목욕 좀 했으면 좋겠군," <<he>>【이가】 미소 지으며 말한다. "어때?"
			<br><br>

			<<link [[에이버리와 함께 목욕한다 (0:30)|Mansion Return Bathe]]>><<pass 10>><<npcincr Avery love 1>><</link>><<glove>>
			<br>
			<<link [[거절한다|Mansion Return Bathe Refuse]]>><<npcincr Avery love -1>><<npcincr Avery rage 1>><</link>><<garage>><<llove>>
			<br>
			<<if $avery_mansion.jobs.includes("dungeon")>>
				<<link [["대신 지하 감옥으로 데려가 달라고 " + KR.getPronounKr("he", $NPCList[0].pronouns.he) + " 제안한다"|Mansion Dungeon Intro Ask]]>><<npcincr Avery dom 1>><</link>><<gdom>>
				<br>
			<</if>>
		<<elseif $rng is 6>>
			"드라이브나 좀 할까," <<he>>【이가】 말한다. "스포츠카로 말이야. 나랑 같이 갈래?"
			<br><br>

			<<link [[에이버리와 함께 차를 탄다 (0:30)|Mansion Return Ride]]>><<pass 10>><</link>>
			<br>
			<<link [[거절한다|Mansion Return Ride Refuse]]>><</link>>
			<br>
			<<if $avery_mansion.jobs.includes("dungeon")>>
				<<link [["대신 지하 감옥으로 데려가 달라고 " + KR.getPronounKr("he", $NPCList[0].pronouns.he) + " 제안한다"|Mansion Dungeon Intro Ask]]>><<npcincr Avery dom 1>><</link>><<gdom>>
				<br>
			<</if>>
		<<elseif $rng is 7>>
			"옷 갈아입을 시간 좀 줘," <<he>>【이가】 말한다. "그러고 나서 배드민턴이나 한두 게임 치지."
			<br><br>

			<<link [[배드민턴을 친다 (0:30)|Mansion Return Badminton]]>><<pass 10>><</link>>
			<br>
			<<link [[거절한다|Mansion Return Badminton Refuse]]>><<npcincr Avery rage 1>><</link>><<garage>>
			<br>
			<<if $avery_mansion.jobs.includes("dungeon")>>
				<<link [["대신 지하 감옥으로 데려가 달라고 " + KR.getPronounKr("he", $NPCList[0].pronouns.he) + " 제안한다"|Mansion Dungeon Intro Ask]]>><<npcincr Avery dom 1>><</link>><<gdom>>
				<br>
			<</if>>
		<</if>>
		<<if $debug is 1>>
			<br><br>
			''디버그 전용''
			<br><br>

			<<link [[에이버리에게 마실 것을 만들어주자고 제안한다|Mansion Return Drink Accept]]>><<npcincr Avery dom 1>><</link>><<gdom>>
